<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500&family=Poppins&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        color: #474747;
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #fff;
        text-align: justify;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .header {
        background-color: #004174;
        background:
          linear-gradient(90deg, #004174 0%, #00568f 100%);
        width: 100%;
        height: 112px;
        text-align: center;
        display: table;
      }

      .header-content {
        display: table-cell;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }

      .header img {
        width: 149px;
        height: 32px;
      }

      .content {
        font-family: "Poppins", sans-serif;
        padding: 20px;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }

      .title {
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 500;
        line-height: 32px;
        color: #474747;
        text-transform: capitalize;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .body-content {
        background-color: #fff;
        width: 100%;
      }

      .body-content p {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .body-content b {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .signature {
        margin-top: 24px;
      }

      .footer {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 32px 16px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-logo {
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .footer-logo img {
        width: 35px;
        height: 25px;
      }

      .social-links {
        margin: 16px auto;
      }

      .social-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        vertical-align: middle;
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0 6px;
      }

      .social-links img {
        width: 24px;
        height: 24px;
        border: 0;
      }

      .copyright {
        margin: 16px auto;
      }

      .footer-links {
        margin-top: 16px;
      }

      .footer-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: #a3a3a3;
      }

      .contact-link {
        color: #004174;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .section-title {
        margin: 8px 0;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        line-height: 1.3;
      }

      .section-title-small {
        font-size: 16px !important;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <!-- Header -->
      <div style="background-color: #004174; padding: 28px 32px; text-align: center">
        <img 
          src="https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/cvtocareer-394713.appspot.com/o/laigusbucket%2FC2C.png?alt=media&token=2c05d23e-1974-4a83-8143-99c1b6b96801" 
          alt="CVtoCAREER Logo" 
          style="display: block; margin: 0 auto 16px auto; width: 149px; height: 32px"
        />
      </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <h1 class="title">Welcome to CVTOCAREER, <%= name %></h1>

      <div class="body-content">
        <b>Dear <%= name %>,</b>

        <p>
          On behalf of the entire
          <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" class="contact-link">CVtoCAREER</a> team,
          I am thrilled to welcome you to our esteemed community! Your decision
          to sign up for our career advisory services at
          <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" class="contact-link">CVtoCAREER</a>
          marks the beginning of a transformative journey towards achieving your
          professional goals.
        </p>

        <p>
          At <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" class="contact-link">CVtoCAREER</a>,
          we understand the significance of career choices and the impact they
          have on your life. Our mission is to empower individuals like you with
          the knowledge, resources, and support needed to navigate the
          complexities of the job market successfully. Whether you are a recent
          graduate, a seasoned professional seeking a career change, or anyone
          in between, we are dedicated to helping you craft a compelling
          narrative that showcases your unique talents and experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
          Once verified, <strong><%= name %></strong> can complete their
          profile, upload a resume, and choose Job Aggregators.
        </p>

        <section>
          <h2 class="section-title section-title-small">
            Here's what you can expect from CVtoCAREER
          </h2>

          <p>
            <b>Personalized Career Guidance:</b> Our team of experienced career
            advisors will provide personalized guidance tailored to your
            aspirations. We will work closely with you to identify your
            strengths, interests, and ambitions, guiding you towards the most
            suitable career path.
          </p>

          <p>
            <b>Professional Resume and CV Writing:</b> Your resume is your first
            impression on potential employers. Our experts will assist you in
            creating a professional resume or curriculum vitae that highlights
            your skills and accomplishments effectively.
          </p>

          <p>
            <b>Interview Coaching:</b> We offer Screening Calls and Panel
            Interview Preparatory Sessions to help you hone your interviewing
            skills. From common interview questions to industry-specific
            queries, we'll prepare you to confidently tackle any interview
            scenario.
          </p>
          <p>
            <b>Job Search Support:</b> Navigating the job market can be
            overwhelming. We provide job search support, helping you identify
            relevant job opportunities and guiding you on how to approach your
            job search strategically.
          </p>

          <p>
            <b>Continuous Support:</b> Your success is our priority. Our team
            will be with you every step of the way, offering continuous support
            and valuable insights to enhance your career prospects.
          </p>
        </section>

        <p>
          To get started, please log in to your
          <a href="<%= frontendUrl %>" class="contact-link">CVtoCAREER</a>
          account and complete your profile.
        </p>

        <p>
          Watch our Introductory Video
          <a
            href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/17tJ_DWz4bTKR9m-YOKD4yNF3H0Lv9DaF/view?pli=1"
            class="contact-link"
            >Click to here to view</a
          >
        </p>

        <div class="signature">
          <p>Thank&nbsp;you,<br />Adetunji&nbsp;Taiwo <br />CVtoCAREER</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
      <div
        style="
          padding: 16px 32px;
          background-color: #f9fafb;
          border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
          text-align: center;
        "
      >
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af">
          © <%= currentYear %> CVtoCAREER. All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
  </body>
</html>
